  "title": "Black Pepper Beef and Cabbage Stir Fry",
  "description": "A very simple Chinese stir-fry dish which is fabulous in taste. I saw my husband going for two additional servings of it and I had to remind him to leave some for the rest of the family! Serve with hot steamed rice.",
